{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01D32PX78C4PD1t8TGDZYxa7", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www1.udel.edu/chem/C465/senior/fall98/Olestra2/!CONS.HTM\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tampabay.com/archive/1996/02/06/the-lowdown-on-faux-fat/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digital.bentley.umich.edu/djnews/djn.1996.09.06.001/65/download_text\"}, {\"url\": \"https://regulations.vlex.com/vid/separate-parts-this-issue-iii-human-22745222\"}, {\"url\": \"https://webharvest.gov/peth04/20041015015744/http:/www.cfsan.fda.gov/~dms/qa-adf8.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://harvardmagazine.com/sites/default/files/html/1996/mj96/right.fat.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://extoxnet.orst.edu/faqs/additive/olestra.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:06:28.663Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "olestra FDA required fortification vitamins A D E K fat-soluble", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01CNnqjMxS1zpnRFDNjPrp4K", "content": [{"title": "www1.udel.edu", "url": "https://www1.udel.edu/chem/C465/senior/fall98/Olestra2/!CONS.HTM"}, {"title": "the lowdown on faux fat", "url": "https://www.tampabay.com/archive/1996/02/06/the-lowdown-on-faux-fat/"}, {"title": "Olestra: a new food additive", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3"}, {"title": "www.govinfo.gov", "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf"}, {"title": "download text", "url": "https://digital.bentley.umich.edu/djnews/djn.1996.09.06.001/65/download_text"}, {"title": "Separate Parts In This Issue Part III Health and Human Services Department, Food and Drug Administration,", "url": "https://regulations.vlex.com/vid/separate-parts-this-issue-iii-human-22745222"}, {"title": "qa adf8", "url": "https://webharvest.gov/peth04/20041015015744/http:/www.cfsan.fda.gov/~dms/qa-adf8.html"}, {"title": "Harvard Magazine", "url": "https://harvardmagazine.com/sites/default/files/html/1996/mj96/right.fat.html"}, {"title": "orst.edu", "url": "https://extoxnet.orst.edu/faqs/additive/olestra.htm"}, {"title": "www.wikipedia.com", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra"}]}, "The FDA required olestra to be fortified with vitamins A, D, E, and K because olestra can carry these fat-soluble nutrients out of the body before they are absorbed. The 1996 rule set the amounts at 170 IU vitamin A, 12 IU vitamin D, 2.8 IU vitamin E, and 8 microgram vitamin K per gram of olestra. The same rule also required a label on olestra foods disclosing the vitamin addition and possible GI effects, and one source notes that the vitamins were added to compensate for any nutritional effects of olestra, rather than to provide enhanced nutritional value.\n\nThe warning label has since changed. Per Wikipedia, the FDA removed the warning requirement in 2003, concluding the label statement was no longer warranted. My searches did not confirm whether the vitamin fortification requirement itself is still in force, so check 21 CFR 172.867 for the current text."], "durationSeconds": 7.032013875, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01D32PX78C4PD1t8TGDZYxa7", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYE2Px76pezcnn4oCB8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:维生素 A、D、E、K。**\n\n美国 FDA 要求含 olestra 的食品添加这四种脂溶性维生素,用来补偿 olestra 会把这些维生素带出体外、影响吸收的问题。1996 年的规定给出的添加量是每克 olestra 含:\n- 维生素 A:170 IU\n- 维生素 D:12 IU\n- 维生素 E:2.8 IU\n- 维生素 K:8 微克\n\n有来源指出,加这些维生素是为了抵消 olestra 的营养影响,不是为了增加营养价值。\n\n另外,据维基百科,FDA 在 2003 年取消了警示标签的要求。我的搜索没有确认维生素添加要求现在是否仍然有效。要确认的话,可以查 21 CFR 172.867 的现行文本。\n\n我只搜了一次。上面的维生素种类和用量来自搜索结果摘要,我没有逐个打开原文核对。\n\nSources:\n- [Olestra - Wikipedia](https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra)\n- [Federal Register, 2003-08-05 (govinfo)](https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf)\n- [FDA CFSAN Q&A on olestra](https://webharvest.gov/peth04/20041015015744/http:/www.cfsan.fda.gov/~dms/qa-adf8.html)\n- [EXTOXNET: Olestra](https://extoxnet.orst.edu/faqs/additive/olestra.htm)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1056, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1056}, "output_tokens": 547, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:06:33.395Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYE266iZvnCjfZ4BDsT"}
